 "persona_full": "[Who I am]\n- I am a man.\n- I live in Uttarakhand.\n- The place I live in has 10,000-20,000 inhabitants.\n- I am Muslim.\n- I am single.\n- I can read and write.\n\n[Work and money]\n- I am not the chief wage earner in my household.\n- My satisfaction with my household's financial situation, from 1 (completely dissatisfied) to 10 (completely satisfied): 5.\n\n[My life]\n- Taking all things together, I am very happy.\n- My health these days is fair.\n- My satisfaction with my life as a whole, from 1 (completely dissatisfied) to 10 (completely satisfied): 10.\n- How much free choice and control I feel I have over my life, from 1 (none at all) to 10 (a great deal): 8.\n- In my neighbourhood I feel quite secure.\n- Family is very important in my life.\n- Friends are very important in my life.\n- Work is very important in my life.\n- Politics is very important in my life.\n- Religion is very important in my life.\n\n[Religion]\n- Apart from weddings and funerals, I attend religious services only on special holy days.\n- How important God is in my life, from 1 (not at all important) to 10 (very important): 10.\n\n[How I see other people]\n- My family: I trust them completely.\n- People in my neighbourhood: I trust them somewhat.\n- People I know personally: I trust them somewhat.\n- People of another religion: I trust them somewhat.\n- People of another nationality: I do not trust them very much.\n\n[What kind of person I am]\n- Thinking up new ideas and being creative, doing things my own way: very much like me.\n- Being rich, having a lot of money and expensive things: very much like me.\n- Living in secure surroundings, avoiding anything that might be dangerous: very much like me.\n- Always behaving properly, avoiding anything people would say is wrong: very much like me.\n- Tradition, following the customs handed down by my religion or family: somewhat like me.\n\n[My views]\n- I am not very interested in politics.\n- From 1 (incomes should be made 